    {
      "text": "Shareholder acceptance remains low, with only about 28.4% of Iveco shares tendered; three major investors (Davidson Kempner, Syquant Capital, Petrus Advisers) hold roughly 20% of shares and have not tendered, threatening the ability to reach the 80% acceptance threshold.",
